{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2526b6428d90527a0d3522388a0a6f62fd09ba523cceca4c46a401c06973e072","ja":"こ、ここは、音楽室なんだ……ひゃあっ！？\n大きいゾンビ！？　は、はやく倒さなきゃ！","zh":"这、这里是音乐教室啊……呀啊！？\n好大的丧尸！？得、得赶快打倒它才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a2a1087e651996fb1804d8aa3c282b9bc1692c5a8ec2223ef3e0516279c13cab","ja":"えいっ……あっ、エネルギー切れ！？\nさっきたくさん撃っちゃったせい！？","zh":"看招……啊，能量用光了！？\n是因为刚才射击太多次了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"12fbd95dc41b60f378aa14571d2a6e7dca883d7669360895a4d0e1acdc4eea48","ja":"未来、杏奈の後ろに隠れてて！\nその間に弾の補充を！","zh":"未来，躲在杏奈身后！\n趁这时间补充弹药！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"99d9714519c9f3de2343028731c85ab46373eb1754dde8ad2fbfea45fd4fdf79","ja":"う、うん！　ありがとう杏奈！\n今の、すっごくカッコよかったよ！","zh":"嗯、嗯！谢谢你，杏奈！\n刚才那下，真的帅呆了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"13616f3efbc22408a7166c2fc57b6b9d6dba4ef08918892ca4055998c082b617","ja":"ありがと♪　多分こいつが、このエリアのボスだよ！\nみんな、気合い入れて、いっくよ～！","zh":"谢谢♪大概这家伙就是这个区域的Boss了！\n大家鼓足干劲，上吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ed9cb9c2757e1f241caf055277dfbc92212ee4938cadee7f92238f75d028ec0b","ja":"わ、私も頑張らなきゃ……って、きゃーっ！\n横からもたくさんゾンビが～っ！？","zh":"我也、我也得加油才行……哇，呀啊——！\n旁边也来了好多丧尸～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"efa46b854d26dd1225d22e189306e1b68e9c99045cb991841c762fbdf3e21cef","ja":"バシュッ！　バシバシュッ！　バシバシバシュッ！\n……グワッ！！　グワッ！！　グワワーッ！！","zh":"唰！　啪唰！　啪啪唰！\n……呱！！　呱！！　呱哇——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9fb66b83b872d80e0ce4d63bda236eb940352d0948664d897dc59808a00fa666","ja":"悲鳴上げながらなのに、的確な攻撃！\nさすがだね～。でも、亜美だって……。","zh":"明明叫得那么惨，攻击却很精准！\n不愧是你呀～。不过，亚美也……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"987c338d95e6e43d8b50170e28f58c35da3eeb829ddcd5ae8cad8b66e7a2d796","ja":"……えっ、どったの？\n……………………そーなんだ。んじゃ……。","zh":"……哎，怎么了吗？\n……………………这样啊。那……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3fd19de090353bd3221ecc04a4327baab5074ef27fd770431ab8384f7e2e3b9e","ja":"えっ、何か言った？　亜美ちゃん。\n…………亜美ちゃん？","zh":"诶，刚才说什么了吗？亚美。\n…………亚美？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7bb762d88de6a8a2dc431e96befda6d2cbdb4a75457aa627d452df0c472e0138","ja":"ど、どうしたの？　急に動かなくなって……。\nボスの特殊攻撃？　それとも、ま、まさか……呪い！？","zh":"怎、怎么了？突然一动不动了……\n是首领的特殊攻击？还是说，难、难道是……诅咒！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1631.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"d3c0f1fbf408e162129e2fd7dd2c8340f54f6a3930e0cca9f6062fc84c039b52","ja":"……ひゃあっ！？\nなにっ！？　なんか今……ほっぺたにペタって！","zh":"……呀啊！？\n什么呀！？刚刚……脸颊上好像被贴了什么东西！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
